  - line: 19
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_operating_environment: catastrophic psychic anguish; recursive temporal distortions and impossible mass effects; Queen's Anunnaki-grown metallic-coral graft structures; Amygdala Analogue as the largest God-Mind fragment; neural spikes and harvested collective telekinesis; slave-powered gravity tethers between fragments; bodies discarded and used as structural mass; Approximately 90% anticipated mortality is an operational claim, not a verified final death count."
  - line: 20
    type: narration
    text: "@scene_meta_continuity.shattered_mind: Broader asteroid-field remains of a prior-cycle God-Mind and causality wound; not merely the resident Spire."
  - line: 21
